<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Blåisvatnet — Blåisvatnet direct marked lake-shore return</name><desc>Follow the direct red-marked walking course from Sør-Lenangsbotn parking to the lake shore and retrace the same complete path. The alternative via Aspevatnet cabins and bridge and any glacier approach are excluded. © Kartverket — https://www.kartverket.no/; TurOgFriluftsruter / Nasjonal database for turruter; contributing maintainer: Lyngen kommune. CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. Changes: complete original walking features transformed from EPSG:25833 to longitude/latitude, two identical shared endpoints deduplicated, and the whole shore walk exactly retraced.

